        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-04-22T05:14:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve introduced microdroid_nodebug (see aosp/3598830), and moved this change over to it.",
      "parentUuid": "3688a27a_13a98ba6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
