      "writtenOn": "2025-05-01T11:24:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One thing that comes to mind is - what population is going to use this config? We can\u0027t use it on droidfood / beta populations, since we definitely want to have metrics + traces from there to monitor rollouts. If we only use it in production, this means that we are running an untested microdroid kernel without any means to debug / investigate failures",
      "parentUuid": "0acd0927_9835e5af",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 39,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 52
